%% caption: How to answer a database probe
flowchart TB
    Q["The question"] --> OP["Answer as an operator, not a DBA"]
    OP --> M["Name the mechanism"]
    M --> C["Name what it costs"]
    C --> S["Name the signal you would watch"]
    S --> EX["Give the concrete number or command"]
    EX --> DONE["e.g. 'replication lag is bytes behind on the WAL — I would alert on seconds_behind and treat it as my RPO'"]
